## Intermediate documents:
*.dvi
*.xdv
*-converted-to.*
# *.ps
# *.eps

# *.pdf/*.png/*.svg used to be blanket-ignored here (leftover from a
# generic LaTeX .gitignore template) -- removed 2026-07-20, direct
# instruction: this project tracks media/ images as real project assets
# (many were already tracked despite this rule, via git add -f overriding
# it), including generated vector figures like media/chart-*.pdf. Compiled
# deck PDFs are a different case -- those regenerate on every compile and
# would bloat history for no benefit, so they're excluded specifically
# below instead of via a rule that also caught real assets.
decks/*.pdf
pdf/*.pdf
# decks/render/: baseline PDFs for a deck's front-to-back final-check
# render/diff pass (see decks/render/compare_render.py's own docstring) --
# same regenerate-on-every-compile reasoning as decks/*.pdf above, just one
# directory deeper than that glob reaches. The .py tooling alongside them
# stays tracked as normal (not covered by this pattern).
decks/render/*.pdf

